your data set exceeds the 500 record limit but contains less than 2,000 records, try resetting the limit.","Try simplifying the formula.","Try moving your data to a different data source."],"whyFix":"","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrInvalidDot","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"The '.' operator cannot be used on {0} values."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrIncompatibleTypesForEquality-Left-Right","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Incompatible types for comparison. These types can't be compared: {0}, {1}."}},"properties":{"howToFix":["You might need to convert the value to be the same type, such as converting a date string (e.g., \"12/31/2018\") to a date value.","If you're comparing records or tables, the field or column types must match exactly."],"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrColDNE-Name","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"The specified column '{0}' does not exist."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrInvalidArgs-Func","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"The function '{0}' has some invalid arguments."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrColumnDoesNotExist-Name-Similar","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"The specified column '{0}' does not exist. The column with the most similar name is '{1}'."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrBadType-ExpectedTypesCSV","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Invalid argument type. Expecting one of the following: {0}."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrIncorrectFormat-Func","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Incorrect format specifier for '{0}'."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"acc-AccessibleLabelNeeded","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing accessible label"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Edit the accessible label property to describe the item."],"whyFix":"If there's no accessible text, people who can’t see the screen won't understand what’s in images and controls.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"acc-TabIndexShouldBeDefinedForInteractiveControl","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing tab stop"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Set TabIndex to 0 or greater to ensure that interactive elements have a tab stop."],"whyFix":"People who use the keyboard with your app will not be able to access this element without a tab stop.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"acc-FocusBorderShouldBeVisible","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Focus isn't showing"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Change the FocusedBorderThickness property to be more than 0."],"whyFix":"If the focus isn't visible, people who don't use a mouse won't be able to see it when they're interacting with the app.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"app-UnusedVariables","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Unused variable"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Remove the unused variable."],"whyFix":"This variable is declared but is not referenced by any control, so it is not needed.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}},{"id":"app-UnusedMediaResources","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Unused media files"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Remove the unused media file in the Media pane."],"whyFix":"This media file is not referenced by any control formulas so it is not needed. Removing it will improve performance.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}},{"id":"app-CollectingReadOnlyTable","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Collection is initialized but never updated"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Replace the Collect or ClearCollect with a named formula on App.Formulas. For example, MyTable = Filter(source, condition). Named formulas are computed when their inputs change and do not carry the tracking cost of a collection."],"whyFix":"Collections are meant to be updated. Power Apps does extra work to keep track of every collection so that anything depending on it stays in sync when the data changes. When the data never changes after it is set, that tracking work is wasted. A named formula gives the same data without the extra cost.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}},{"id":"app-CrossScreenEventDependencies","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Event rule references a control on another screen"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Move the work to an event on the owning screen (for example, Screen.OnVisible), or pass state between screens using Navigate's context parameter or a global variable and react to it on the target screen."],"whyFix":"Event rules (such as OnStart, OnVisible, and OnSelect) that reference controls on other screens force those screens to load and initialize early, even if the user never navigates to them. This can noticeably slow app start-up and navigation.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}},{"id":"app-InefficientDelayLoading","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Inefficient delay loading"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Use variables, collections, and navigation context to share state across screens instead."],"whyFix":"Controls that reference controls on other screens can slow down app loading and navigation. Doing this may force the app to load the other screens immediately, rather than waiting until the user navigates to that screen.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}}]}},"invocations":[{"executionSuccessful":true}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits"}]}